The Semi-ATE STDF implementation represents a significant rewrite with:
- New CLI tool with comprehensive command set
- Enhanced parsing capabilities and iterators
- Python bindings via PyO3
- Additional data export formats
- Cross-platform packaging and distribution

While inspired by the original cmars/stdf architecture, this implementation
includes substantial modifications, new features, and different design choices.
